# Blocks catalog sync

When you **create or materially change** a file under `Blocks/` that calls `register_block(...)`:

1. Ensure the file has a standard header (purpose, config example, pipeline position).
2. Run from repo root: `python3 scripts/update_blocks_catalog.py`
3. Follow `.cursor/skills/update-blocks-catalog/SKILL.md` (update MANUAL §1–§3 only if a new routine/global key/pitfall appears).

Do not hand-edit `<!-- BEGIN AUTO:` sections in `docs/Blocks_catalog.md`.
